<title>HUNGARY: Block deal on Hungary's Mezogep, HUF2,100.</title>
<headline>Block deal on Hungary's Mezogep, HUF2,100.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 3.53 percent share package in Hungarian machinery company Mezogep Rt changed hands in an agency cross on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>In the deal 280,000 shares traded at 2,100 forints each in the first deal for Mezogep papers during the session, overtaking the role of the day's most actively traded paper in terms of volume in the first three quarter of hours of trading.</p>
<p>Mezogep has an issued share capital of 792.6 million forints, made up of 100-forint face value stocks.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
